WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.230 --> 00:00:03.830
Did you sign something so that Manny could
switch to French?

00:00:03.830 --> 00:00:04.460
I did.

00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:06.280
You knew that I wanted him to learn Spanish.

00:00:06.290 --> 00:00:09.770
I also know you can't force a kid to be
interested in something that he's not.

00:00:09.770 --> 00:00:13.250
That's why I have a picture of Mitchell and his prom
date shaking hands.

00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:16.010
It would be nice for someone to care what I
think, for a change.

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:18.920
You should also know that I hired a new
swimming instructor.

00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:22.430
But don't worry, she's got the same broad shoulders
plus a mustache.

00:00:22.430 --> 00:00:28.580
So all this is because you're jealous? I
can't believe that you're being so infere-

00:00:29.690 --> 00:00:31.400
What is the word?

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:31.910
Selfish. Pigheaded.

00:00:31.910 --> 00:00:32.780
Really?

00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:33.680
Her words, not mine.

00:00:33.710 --> 00:00:38.900
Do you know how frustrating it is to have to
translate everything in my head before I say it?

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:43.130
To have people laugh in my face because
I'm struggling to find the words?

00:00:43.130 --> 00:00:45.650
You should try talking in my shoes for one mile.

00:00:45.650 --> 00:00:46.370
I think you meant-

00:00:46.370 --> 00:00:47.960
I know what I meant to mean.

00:00:48.380 --> 00:00:50.810
Do you even know how smart I am in Spanish?

00:00:51.170 --> 00:00:53.450
Of course you don't.

00:00:53.450 --> 00:00:58.220
For once, it would be nice to speak to someone in
my own language in my own home.

00:01:02.290 --> 00:01:05.710
Listen, I'm sorry I let Manny switch over to
French without consulting you.

00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:09.280
I didn't think how it must be for you having to speak
English all the time.

00:01:09.280 --> 00:01:10.240
You have no idea.

00:01:10.270 --> 00:01:13.000
Anyway, I just wanted to tell you I hired a
tutor back.

00:01:13.150 --> 00:01:16.320
Manny's not going to like that. He's too
much into his French thing.

00:01:16.330 --> 00:01:18.490
The tutor is not for Manny. It's for me.

00:01:20.190 --> 00:01:29.090
[Speaks in Spanish]

00:01:29.540 --> 00:01:31.200
Ah Jay, I love it!

00:01:31.230 --> 00:01:33.960
Now you sound like the stupid one!

